SUMMARY:Lord Abbett Coffee Chats
LOCATION:Center for Career Development
DESCRIPTION:Chuck Rozakis '03 from Lord\, Abbett & Co.is available to mee
 t with all interested Princeton students. As 20-year veteran of the fina
 nce industry and an out bisexual man\, Chuck Rozakis ’03 discusses the
  ins and outs of being an openly queer person in the workplace and how t
 hey have changed over the course of his two-decade career\nhttps://caree
 rdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/lord-abbett-coffee-chats
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/lord-abbett-coffee-cha
 ts
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
